{
  "text": "Last year I started doing these quarterly recap and looking back at where God has taken me since has humbled me. In quarter one, I've helped more than 27 families step into a new chapter, and I truly cannot express how grateful I am for the people who support me and trust me with all the biggest decisions of their lives. These have been some of the biggest months I've ever had in real estate, and I've closed every 10 million. I've gotten to walk families through relocating to North Carolina, hand keys to first -time homebuyers, and partner with some of the best builders in my area. And every story has been one of a kind. I'm even more excited for what God has planned for this next quarter, and I want to thank you for being a part of it.",
